  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Better Quality Services for the Prevention, Diagnosis and Treatment of Chronic Noncommunicable Diseases</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mejora de la calidad de los servicios de prevencin, diagnstico y tratamiento de Enfermedades Crnicas No Transmisibles</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de la operacin es contribuir a reducir la morbilidad y mortalidad asociadas a Enfermedades Crnicas No Transmisibles (ECNT). Los objetivos especficos son: (i) fortalecer la gobernanza e informacin para la toma de decisiones; (ii) fortalecer las capacidades de prevencin, identificacin de riesgos y diagnstico oportuno; (iii) mejorar las capacidades de monitoreo, tratamiento y continuidad del cuidado.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the operation is to help reduce the morbidity and mortality associated with Non-Communicable Chronic Diseases (NCDs). The specific objectives are: (i) to strengthen governance and information for decision-making; (ii) to enhance prevention capacities, risk identification, and timely diagnosis; (iii) to improve monitoring, treatment, and continuity of care capabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
